## API skill files

Per-API agent references (one markdown file each):

- [Abstract](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/abstractapi/skill.md): Verify every user and stop fraud before it starts. Verify emails, phone numbers and IPs, block fraud and bots, and enrich your data with Abstract.
- [AgentMail](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/agentmail/skill.md): Programmatic email for AI agents. Create inboxes, send/receive emails, manage threads and drafts. Inboxes cost $2/month. Inboxes inactive for 30+ days are automatically deleted.
- [AgentPhone](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/agentphone/skill.md): Give your AI agent a real phone number. Make calls, send and receive messages across iMessage, WhatsApp, SMS and more to have conversations in the real world — all via API.
- [Airscale](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/airscale/skill.md): Airscale B2B data API: find professional and personal emails and mobile numbers, extract person and company profiles, reverse email/phone lookups, search people and companies for list building, company lookalikes, Airsearch web research, LinkedIn post and engagement data, website technologies, ad lookups, Google Maps search, email verification and DNC checks.
- [akta.pro](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/akta-pro/skill.md): akta.pro provides structured company data with deep private-company coverage, company discovery, real-time and historical news, business-event signals and alternative data for AI agents and data products. Built for financial-services platforms, PE/VC and investment teams, consulting and research workflows, GTM and revenue-intelligence products, and agent routers. Use it to enrich companies, build lists and market maps, monitor company or industry news, surface GTM and buying signals from events such as funding, M&A, leadership changes, hiring, launches and partnerships, and analyze headcount, jobs, website traffic, social activity, employee reviews and product reviews. Responses are structured, entity-resolved and compact for reliable agent routing and workflow automation.
- [AllModels](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/allmodels/skill.md): Unified TTS and STT API aggregating 18+ speech providers including Deepgram, ElevenLabs, OpenAI, AssemblyAI, Cartesia, Soniox, Groq, Fish Audio, MiniMax, Amazon Polly, Gemini, xAI Grok, and more. OpenAI and ElevenLabs SDK-compatible endpoints for text-to-speech synthesis, speech-to-text transcription, voice cloning, and voice discovery. Access 42+ TTS models and 39+ STT models through a single API key and unified interface.
- [Andi Search](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/andi/skill.md): AI Search for the Next Generation
- [Apollo](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/apollo/skill.md): Apollo.io API for people and company enrichment, search, and prospecting. Access the Apollo database of 210M+ contacts and 30M+ companies.
- [Aviato](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/aviato/skill.md): Comprehensive company and person intelligence platform. Enrich companies and people, search with advanced DSL queries, get funding rounds, investments, employees, founders, contact info, LinkedIn social data, and market maps.
