- [Serper Scrape](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/serper-scrape/skill.md): Web scraping powered by Serper - extract clean text, markdown, or HTML from any URL. Handles JavaScript-rendered pages and returns structured content with metadata.
- [Signalbase](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/signalbase/skill.md): Real-time funding, acquisition, hiring, and job change signals API. Includes investor data, company search, people discovery, and batch CSV enrichment.
- [Sixtyfour](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/sixtyfour/skill.md): Build custom research agents to enrich people and company data, and surface real-time signals all with a simple API call.
- [Smol Machines](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/smolmachines/skill.md): Cloud microVM platform. Create isolated Linux VMs, execute commands, run code, manage files and volumes. Each machine has its own kernel with configurable CPU, memory, networking, and storage.
- [Tako](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/tako/skill.md): Tako is a knowledge search engine that visualizes the world's data. Search with natural language to get interactive knowledge cards with charts, tables, and insights powered by sources like S&P Global, World Bank, and more.
- [Tavily](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/tavily/skill.md): Real-time search, extraction, and web crawling through a single, secure API.
- [Tomba](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/tomba/skill.md): Email finding and verification API
- [Trestle](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/trestle/skill.md): Trestle identity data APIs: validate, verify and enrich phone numbers, emails, addresses and IP addresses. Phone validation (carrier, line type, activity score), caller name (CNAM), caller identification, reverse phone and reverse address lookups, address validation, contact grading for lead quality (Real Contact), identity decision signals for fraud prevention, and live-call phone feedback. Trestle data is not a consumer report and must not be used for FCRA-regulated eligibility decisions.
- [Voygr](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/voygr/skill.md): Validate whether a business exists at a given address and check if it is currently open or closed.
- [You.com](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/you/skill.md): Real-time web search, content extraction, and deep research APIs for AI agents.
